backups/
*-backup-*.json

# Written and re-added by `next dev` (see node_modules/next/dist/server/lib/
# generate-agent-files.js), not by us. It points agents at the Next docs bundled
# in node_modules, which in this repo describe APIs that do not exist, so it
# stays out of the tree rather than becoming permanent instructions. The
# hand-written apps/*/CLAUDE.md files are unaffected and stay tracked.
AGENTS.md
apps/dt365-frontend/CLAUDE.md
